---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy of New Life Integration & Wellbeing Network CLG.">
	
	<section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-teal-950/40 via-background to-background pt-20 pb-12 text-center relative border-b border-border/40">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
			<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
				How New Life Integration & Wellbeing Network CLG handles and protects your personal data in accordance with GDPR regulations.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="py-16">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground space-y-6">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">1. Data Controller</h2>
			<p>
				New Life Integration & Wellbeing Network CLG is the data controller for any personal information submitted via our forms or email support channels (<a href="mailto:info@newlifeintegration.ie" class="text-primary hover:underline">info@newlifeintegration.ie</a>).
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
			<p>
				We collect your name, email, phone number, and any details you voluntarily submit via our Contact and Branch Launch forms. This information is only processed to answer your inquiries and coordinate applications.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">3. Data Retention</h2>
			<p>
				We retain your personal data for no longer than necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was collected or to comply with legal obligations in Ireland.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">4. Your Rights</h2>
			<p>
				Under GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, or erase your personal data at any time. Simply reach out to us at <a href="mailto:info@newlifeintegration.ie" class="text-primary hover:underline">info@newlifeintegration.ie</a> to submit a request.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>
